      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present The Waterways, Mungret to the market. Set on approximately 0.6 acres, this spacious 5-bedroom bungalow offers generous living accommodation and bright, well-proportioned interiors throughout. Its idyllic setting and substantial grounds make it an ideal family home, offering both comfort and space in a peaceful location.\n\nLocated within easy reach of Mungret Village, The Waterways enjoys a highly attractive setting in one of Limerick's most sought-after residential areas. University Hospital Limerick, Raheen Business Park, and a selection of renowned primary and secondary schools, including St. Paul's National School, St. Nessan's National School, Mungret Community College, and Crescent College Comprehensive, are all within a five-minute drive. The area boasts an abundance of amenities, including leisure facilities, restaurants, shops, and the Crescent Shopping Centre. Regular bus routes service the area, while immediate access to the M7 motorway network provides excellent connectivity to Castletroy, Annacotty, Shannon Airport, Dublin, and Galway. The property also benefits from being just a 10-minute drive from the picturesque village of Adare and the world-renowned Adare Manor, host venue of the 2027 Ryder Cup, adding further appeal to this exceptional location.\n\nOccupying a superb 0.6-acre site on the outskirts of Raheen and Dooradoyle, the property benefits from a private rear garden surrounded by mature trees and shrubbery, creating a wonderful sense of seclusion and offering excellent potential for further extension, subject to the necessary planning permissions. This charming home presents a fantastic opportunity for families seeking a forever home in a prime location.\n\nInternally, the property is accessed via a side entrance. The accommodation is bright and welcoming, with the kitchen forming the heart of the home. The kitchen is fully tiled and fitted with contemporary units, providing ample storage and workspace. To the front of the property, the living room features a charming open fireplace and carpet flooring, creating a cosy space to relax and unwind.\n\nThe principal bedroom is positioned to the rear of the property and benefits from built-in wardrobes, carpet flooring, and an en-suite bathroom. Bedroom two is a spacious double room with built-in wardrobes, while bedrooms three and four are also generously sized double rooms. The fifth bedroom offers flexibility and could alternatively be used as a family room, playroom, or home office to suit a purchaser's needs. A family bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nOutside, the property is accessed through gated entrances leading to a driveway with ample parking. The beautifully maintained gardens provide an attractive countryside feel while remaining close to all essential amenities. A detached garage to the rear offers valuable additional storage and convenience.\n\nThe Waterways combines generous accommodation, substantial private grounds, and excellent convenience in a peaceful Mungret setting, making it an ideal home for families seeking space, privacy, and easy access to Raheen, Dooradoyle, and Limerick City. \n\nEarly viewing recommended!\n\nAccommodation- Porch, hallway, bathroom, 5 bedrooms, Kitchen/dining, living room, ensuite .\nServices: OFCH, gated entrance, private garden, garage."
      },
